{
    "title": "\u062e\u0648\u0627\u0633\u062a\u06af\u0627\u0631\u06cc",
    "description": "\ud83d\ude0d Competing in the biggest courtship meeting \ud83d\udc93\r\nCan you open your place in the heart of this family?!\r\n\r\nA romantic challenge\r\n\u2764\ufe0f This year, Mr. Houshang wants to get a wife anyway, we should help him too\u2764\ufe0f\r\nCourtship with a beautiful and pleasant mood;\r\nA family and a smart man who has to take care of everyone, Akram, who is lovingly waiting for the arrival of Hoshang, doesn't know what his father has plans for his son-in-law.\r\n\r\n The most handsome bride and groom\r\nDelight Akram and Houshang by changing their clothes\r\nand show it to the other players\r\n\r\nIn this game, you will be in the atmosphere of a courtship meeting and face the questions of the elders of the bride's family. You have to try to get everyone's satisfaction and finally satisfy the bride's father...\r\nEveryone wants to waste Hoshang!!\r\n_With completely Iranian atmosphere and personality\r\nWith a large number of steps\r\n\ud83d\udca3 Show off your general information and try not to belittle the bride's family\r\n -- If you like the game, don't forget the stars and points --\r\nYou are also invited to this big party\r\n If you see any problem, please let us know first through in-game Telegram support or our email....\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcf1 Information about new programs in\r\nInstagram page:\r\nInstagram.com/unides_app\r\nTelegram channel :\r\n@virgool_u",
    "descriptionHTML": "\ud83d\ude0d Competing in the biggest courtship meeting \ud83d\udc93<br>Can you open your place in the heart of this family?!<br><br>A romantic challenge<br>\u2764\ufe0f This year, Mr. Houshang wants to get a wife anyway, we should help him too\u2764\ufe0f<br>Courtship with a beautiful and pleasant mood;<br>A family and a smart man who has to take care of everyone, Akram, who is lovingly waiting for the arrival of Hoshang, doesn&#39;t know what his father has plans for his son-in-law.<br><br> The most handsome bride and groom<br>Delight Akram and Houshang by changing their clothes<br>and show it to the other players<br><br>In this game, you will be in the atmosphere of a courtship meeting and face the questions of the elders of the bride&#39;s family. You have to try to get everyone&#39;s satisfaction and finally satisfy the bride&#39;s father...<br>Everyone wants to waste Hoshang!!<br>_With completely Iranian atmosphere and personality<br>With a large number of steps<br>\ud83d\udca3 Show off your general information and try not to belittle the bride&#39;s family<br> -- If you like the game, don&#39;t forget the stars and points --<br>You are also invited to this big party<br> If you see any problem, please let us know first through in-game Telegram support or our email....<br><br>\ud83d\udcf1 Information about new programs in<br>Instagram page:<br>Instagram.com/unides_app<br>Telegram channel :<br>@virgool_u",
